slipstream-logo.txt and slipstream-logo-stacked.txt are the word SLIPSTREAM drawn in Chakra Petch
Bold (the display face in assets/fonts, OFL), slanted, as quarter-cell block characters.
Regenerate with slipstream-logo.py (needs Pillow):

    python3 slipstream-logo.py fonts/ChakraPetch-Bold.ttf slipstream-logo --skew 0.22
